        "original_id": "22803e03-0135-534e-bcba-084c41c3e2ce",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Pledis Entertainment\n- People: Han Sung-soo, Son Dam-bi, Kahi, JR, Baekho, Yoo Ara, Lime, Park Jung-hyun\n- Groups: After School, Orange Caramel, NU'EST, Seventeen, Pristin, Hello Venus\n- Products: Happy Pledis 2nd Album\n- Concepts: K-pop sub-units\n\nFacts:\n- Pledis Entertainment is a South Korean record label and entertainment agency founded in 2007 by Han Sung-soo.\n- Pledis Entertainment is home to After School, Orange Caramel, NU'EST, Han Dong Geun, Kye Bumzu, Seventeen, and Pristin.\n- Seventeen consists of thirteen members divided into a Hip-Hop Unit, a Vocal Unit, and a Performance Unit.\n- Happy Pledis 2nd Album is a charity single by Pledis Entertainment artists Son Dam-bi, Kahi, After School, NU'EST members JR and Baekho, Hello Venus members Yoo Ara and Lime, and Pre-School Girl Park Jung-hyun.",
